<title>MEXICO: Mexico lowers jet fuel prices - Pemex.</title>
<headline>Mexico lowers jet fuel prices - Pemex.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state and oil gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) lowered its jet fuel prices as of April to 1,531.83 pesos per cubic meter from 1,535.35 pesos, the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Pemex periodically adjusts its jet fuel prices in accordance with international market prices.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
